  "releaseNotes": "new package: the ini support of SadPencil.Ra2CsfFile moves here, together with the bundled patched ini-parser as SadPencil.Ra2CsfFile.IniParser 2.6.0; preserve the whitespace of label values loaded from an ini file; drop the WhiteSpaceWarning key from generated ini files; remove CsfFileIniHelper.TrimMultiLine; fix a bug where labels were not sorted when writing an ini file; reject an ini key that ends with whitespace instead of trimming it; warn at build time when the upstream ini parser is referenced too",
